OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrillions of dollars in market value
OL,7,Fhas been wiped from major tech firms in
OL,8,Fthe US, Europe and Asia in a stock
OL,9,Fmarket rout after the US midterm
OL,10,Felections sparked concerns of a
OL,11,Fslowdown in artificial intelligence
OL,12,Fdevelopment.
OL,14,FShares in firms across the tech and AI
OL,15,Fsectors plummeted following Democratic
OL,16,Fwins after election campaigns run on
OL,17,Fslowing AI.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
